        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You conjure an emoji of a weapon. Attempt a spell attack roll against a target's AC within 60 feet of the emoji (or adjacent if the emoji is a melee weapon), dealing 4d6 force damage on a hit (double damage on a critical hit). You can repeat the attack as a reaction when a creature in range uses a manipulate action (or move action, if the emoji is a melee weapon), but the spell ends at the start of your turn if you haven't used this reaction since the end of your previous turn. You can move the emoji each time you Sustain the Spell.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
